@* A Board · Dashboard · Report tab (HtmxExtensions.IsTabSwap): only the page's #kb-tab-page, its title and the top bar's
   actions (the tab swaps them along, hx-select-oob). The side menu, the top bar, the tab row and the account menu stay as
   they are; the tab row's active state follows #kb-tab-page's data-page (page-tabs.js). *@
@{
    IgnoreSection("UserMenu");
}
<title>@ViewData["Title"] - Columnist</title>
@RenderBody()
<div id="kb-topbar-actions" class="kb-topbar-actions">@await RenderSectionAsync("TopBar", required: false)</div>
